    "title": "KRUE Events to host free community meal giveaway Thursday in Shreveport - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amia Lewis ,\n5 hours ago SHREVEPORT, La. (KSLA) - KRUE Events, a restaurant in downtown Shreveport, will host a community food giveaway Thursday, Nov. 6 from 5-7 p.m. at 830 Louisiana Avenue. The event is free and open to the public, offering meals while supplies last to help local families affected by recent economic challenges and delays in food stamp benefits. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
